---
title: Training a sparse-attention model
---
flowchart LR
    data[(Corpus)] --> tok[Tokenise]
    tok --> blocks["Split keys into blocks of $$b$$"]
    blocks --> score["Score blocks: $$s_i = q \cdot \bar{k}_i$$"]
    score --> choose{"Discarded mass $$\delta < \varepsilon$$?"}
    choose -- yes --> read[Read top-k blocks]
    choose -- no --> grow[Increase k] --> score
    read --> loss["Loss $$\ell = -\log p(y \mid x)$$"]
    loss --> update[Update weights]
    update -. next batch .-> tok

    classDef store fill:#e8eef7,stroke:#5b7fa6
    class data store
